              "content": {
                "text": "Small Business ({company_name}). A 3,200 sq ft engineering facility with a dedicated acoustics bench, a custom anechoic test enclosure, six 2-watt edge-compute development kits, an on-premises GPU training cluster, and a calibrated power-measurement bench for rail-level draw. All Phase I edge-AI development and benchmarking is performed in-house.",
